'/faq':{title:'Frequently asked questions',intro:'Honest answers about the current release.',sections:[['Can it predict every failure?','No. Preflight performs supported static checks. It cannot prove deployment safety or predict every runtime, infrastructure, or business failure.'],['Does it run my application?','No. This release candidate does not execute uploaded code, customer commands, or tests. Runtime simulation remains disabled.'],['Can I scan private GitHub repositories?','Private GitHub authentication is not enabled. You may upload authorized source archives, subject to the stated data-handling limitations.'],['Can I register or pay now?','No. Administrators provision evaluation accounts. Public registration and live payment collection remain disabled.'],['How do I get help?','Email zevqlabs@gmail.com with a scan ID and an error description. Never email credentials or confidential source code.']]}
